### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 01 — SYSTEM HEALTH, METRICS & SYSTEM INFO
###
### These endpoints are fully public — no API key required.
### Run these first to confirm the server is up before anything else.
###
### Prerequisites: ArcClaw running in serve mode on port 8080
###   mvnw quarkus:dev -pl arcclaw-app -am "-Dquarkus.args=serve"
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SYSTEM INFO  (always public — ApiKeyAuthFilter explicitly skips /info)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [INFO-1] System metadata — name, version, environment, startedAt
# Expect 200: {"name":"arcclaw","version":"1.0.0","environment":"dev","startedAt":"..."}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/info

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HEALTH CHECKS  (/q/health — Quarkus SmallRye Health, no auth)
# Three checks registered:
#   PodmanHealthCheck      — Liveness  (podman --version succeeds)
#   PodmanImageHealthCheck — Readiness (arcclaw-tool-runner:latest present)
#   SystemMetadataHealthCheck — Readiness (registry populated)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [HEALTH-1] Combined health (all liveness + readiness checks)
# Expect 200: {"status":"UP","checks":[...]}
# Note: PodmanImageHealthCheck may report DOWN in %dev if image not built — that is expected.
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/health

###

### [HEALTH-2] Liveness only — is the JVM alive?
# Expect 200: {"status":"UP","checks":[{"name":"podman","status":"UP",...}]}
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/health/live

###

### [HEALTH-3] Readiness only — is the app ready to accept traffic?
# Expect 200 or 503 depending on whether Podman image is present
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/health/ready

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PROMETHEUS METRICS  (/q/metrics — no auth, scrape endpoint)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [METRICS-1] Full Prometheus text format
# Expect 200: large prometheus text body with jvm_*, http_*, arcclaw_* metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/metrics

###

### [METRICS-2] Filter for ArcClaw-specific counters only (if supported by your client)
# In curl: curl http://localhost:8080/q/metrics | grep arcclaw
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/metrics

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPENAPI / SWAGGER UI
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [SWAGGER-1] OpenAPI spec (JSON)
# Expect 200: full OpenAPI 3.0 spec
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/openapi

###

### [SWAGGER-2] Swagger UI landing page (browser-friendly)
# Open in browser: http://localhost:8080/q/swagger-ui
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/swagger-ui

###
